-│   ├── docs/                          ← WHITEPAPER.md (v1.0.4 canonical), ERRATA, PORTS
-│   ├── reports/                       ← all PDFs (also at top-level reports/)
-│   ├── Makefile + INSTALL.md + RELEASE-NOTES.md + SHA256SUMS + .gitignore
